      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Optimized Analytics Workflow\n\n**Key Improvements:**\n1. **Parallel Execution**: Data streams (Engagement, Search, Country) run in parallel branches rather than a linear chain.\n2. **Clean JSON**: Removed the `encodeURIComponent` anti-pattern. Data is passed as native JSON objects.\n3. **Central Config**: Edit the 'Config' node to set Property ID and Email once.\n4. **Error Handling**: An Error Trigger sends an email if the workflow crashes.",
